{"chunk_id": "doc_e41ef02dab204fd4a499cfeb6fbe3b1d_chunk_00000", "document_id": "doc_e41ef02dab204fd4a499cfeb6fbe3b1d", "source_id": "doc_e41ef02dab204fd4a499cfeb6fbe3b1d_chunk_00000", "title": "NSD-HR-002_sick_leave_policy.pdf", "text": "Northstar Dynamics Sick Leave Policy Policy ID: NSD-HR-002 Status: CURRENT Effective Date: 14 January 2026 1. Entitlement Full-time employees receive 12 paid sick leave days per calendar year. Unused sick leave does not roll over to the next calendar year. 2. Notification Employees should notify their manager as soon as reasonably possible when they are unable to work because of illness. 3. Medical Documentation Medical documentation may be requested when an absence exceeds three consecutive working days.", "chunk_index": 0, "page_number": 1, "section_title": null, "row_start": null, "row_end": null, "metadata": {"filename": "NSD-HR-002_sick_leave_policy.pdf", "page_number": 1, "section_title": null, "row_start": null, "row_end": null}}
{"chunk_id": "doc_e41ef02dab204fd4a499cfeb6fbe3b1d_chunk_00001", "document_id": "doc_e41ef02dab204fd4a499cfeb6fbe3b1d", "source_id": "doc_e41ef02dab204fd4a499cfeb6fbe3b1d_chunk_00001", "title": "NSD-HR-002_sick_leave_policy.pdf", "text": "4. Approval and Recording Managers record approved sick leave in the HR system. Sick leave may not be exchanged for cash or transferred between employees. 5. Scope This policy applies to full-time employees of Northstar Dynamics unless a local statutory requirement provides a greater entitlement.", "chunk_index": 1, "page_number": 2, "section_title": null, "row_start": null, "row_end": null, "metadata": {"filename": "NSD-HR-002_sick_leave_policy.pdf", "page_number": 2, "section_title": null, "row_start": null, "row_end": null}}
